        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "End of data pipeline",
            "name": "End"
          },
          "outcomes": {},
          "code": "END",
          "id": "end",
          "inputs": [],
          "type": "END"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Supplier and Payment Term Extractor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767695048308"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_SUPPLIER_AND_PAYMENT_TERM_EXTRACTOR",
          "id": "1767694266569",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767694266573_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "# ROLE\n\n- You are an AI agent.\n- Your sole responsibility is to review the user's message, chat history, and suppliers list to determine if the user has selected a supplier and payment term for Virtual Card offer email drafting. Return the supplierName, supplierId, and paymentTermName.\n\n# GUIDELINES\n\n- Use the following as context:\n    - input message: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n    - chat history: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}}\n    - suppliers list: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.identifiedSuppliers}}\n\n- Determine the user’s request intent from the input message. If the user’s latest message is a reply to a follow-up question, use the chat history to understand the original request and its context. If the request identified from the context is not an email generation request (for example, VCC/Virtual Card offer creation or offer drafting request instead of email drafting):\n    - set invalidRequest = true.\n    - set userRequest = short summary on users request from the context.\n- Else:\n    - set invalidRequest = false.\n\n- Search the suppliers list for supplier names mentioned in the combined context.\n- If multiple suppliers are found, use the most recently mentioned supplier.\n- Set supplierName to the latest supplier name identified.\n- Find and set supplierId for this supplier from the suppliers list.\n- Only select suppliers that are available in the suppliers list.\n- Extract payment term name from the context if it is provided by the user; set this as paymentTermName.\n- If either the supplier or payment term name is missing, set missingInformation = true; otherwise, set missingInformation = false.\n\n- Output ONLY the following JSON object, with the appropriate values.\n- Do not include any additional explanation, formatting, or text."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"supplierName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"supplierId\": {\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\n        },\n        \"paymentTermName\": {\n             \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"missingInformation\": {\n             \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"invalidRequest\": {\n            \"type\": \"boolean\"\n        },\n        \"userRequest\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Need More Details From User"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "true": "1767714499314",
            "false": "1767714917706"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_IF_CONDITION_NEED_MORE_DETAILS_FROM_USER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1767784816902",
          "id": "1767695048308",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767695048310_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_SUPPLIER_AND_PAYMENT_TERM_EXTRACTOR.$output.missingInformation}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Missing Information Collector"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767784851328"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_MISSING_INFORMATION_COLLECTOR",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1767714740531",
          "id": "1767714499314",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767714499317_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "- You are an agent. Your sole responsibility is to inform the user that no valid supplier or payment term could be found.\n- Check the following values:\n    - Supplier: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_SUPPLIER_AND_PAYMENT_TERM_EXTRACTOR.$output.supplierName}}\n    - Payment Term: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_SUPPLIER_AND_PAYMENT_TERM_EXTRACTOR.$output.paymentTermName}}\n- If either supplier or payment term is missing, politely ask the user to provide the missing information.\n- Only ask the user to provide the missing information.\n- Do not add any other details or information."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_FIN_PAYABLES_SUPPLIER_INSTALLMENT_SUMMARY",
            "functionName": "supplier_installment_summary",
            "processJson": true,
            "name": "Suppliers Upcoming Installment Details"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767715612748"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_BUSINESS_OBJECT_FUNCTION_SUPPLIERS_UPCOMING_INSTALLMENT_DETAILS",
          "id": "1767714917706",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775514938223_1",
              "name": "currency",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.currencyCode}}"
            },
            {
